WEBVTT

01:44.660 --> 01:47.620
The event takes place in our neighbor city at Takura High School.

01:47.620 --> 01:50.670
This pool is cleaner than Umisho's pool!

01:50.980 --> 01:54.580
Takura High School puts a lot of emphasis on their swimming team.

01:54.580 --> 01:58.760
We should become a stronger team so that we can have a new pool built,

01:58.760 --> 02:02.100
now that we've added Amuro-senpai to our team!

02:03.180 --> 02:04.390
You're embarrassing me.

02:04.740 --> 02:06.090
Don't be naive.

02:06.090 --> 02:08.350
The competition isn't only about technique.

02:08.350 --> 02:13.400
It depends on whether or not Ninagawa-san can handle the pressure of a real race.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.790
Hello, Sensei.

02:20.790 --> 02:22.780
Please take good care of us this year.

02:23.920 --> 02:28.500
I think you'll get some great results at the inter-high competition this year, Orizuka-kun.

02:28.500 --> 02:29.930
Oh, please.

02:29.930 --> 02:32.620
I don't even know if I can go to the inter-high competition.

02:32.620 --> 02:36.130
If you're worried, why don't you come to our school to practice?

02:36.510 --> 02:39.010
If you do, I can teach you all the best--

02:39.530 --> 02:42.060
I must decline.

02:43.850 --> 02:46.000
Come to think of it, where's the captain?

02:46.000 --> 02:47.890
Ikamasa said that he'd be late.

02:47.890 --> 02:48.560
Geez.

02:48.910 --> 02:51.360
Umisho has a lot of cute girls.

02:51.360 --> 02:52.110
Yeah.

03:17.210 --> 03:20.360
I'm Ninagawa Amuro, a second year student at Umisho.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.680
Nice to meet you!

03:24.620 --> 03:26.030
N-Nice to meet you.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.760
What race are you participating in?

03:28.110 --> 03:29.410
The butterfly, actually...

03:29.410 --> 03:31.140
I didn't know Umisho had a girl like that.

03:33.930 --> 03:34.980
Hey!

03:35.330 --> 03:37.410
If you bother the other swimmers...

03:37.980 --> 03:40.640
She's not feeling any pressure.

03:40.640 --> 03:41.990
Geez.

03:42.990 --> 03:45.760
And so, the tri-meet has begun.

03:47.000 --> 03:47.990
Ready!

04:06.680 --> 04:09.110
Women's 200 meter freestyle.

04:09.110 --> 04:11.940
1st place, Umisho, Orizuka-san.

04:14.760 --> 04:16.080
Good work!

04:16.690 --> 04:19.230
Let's win the 100 meter, too!

04:19.230 --> 04:20.690
Well, I'll do my best.

04:22.390 --> 04:25.420
Orizuka-senpai, you swam well!

04:25.420 --> 04:26.470
Thanks.

04:26.470 --> 04:28.490
Hey, hey, when is it my turn?!

04:28.490 --> 04:32.000
Amuro-senpai, you're in the 50 meter freestyle, right?

04:32.000 --> 04:33.210
It's still awhile from now.

04:33.470 --> 04:34.710
Don't get ahead of yourself.

04:35.460 --> 04:38.290
Is the person participating in the men's 100 meter butterfly, Ikariya-kun

04:38.650 --> 04:39.560
from Umisho, here?

04:39.560 --> 04:41.670
This is the captain's race.

04:41.670 --> 04:44.050
Hey, Ikamasa isn't here yet?!

04:44.050 --> 04:46.050
Hey, I'm sorry!

04:47.350 --> 04:49.130
I lost them.

04:49.130 --> 04:50.560
The directions?

04:50.560 --> 04:51.540
No...

04:51.540 --> 04:54.040
The Speedos I'm going to wear today.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.890
Hurry up and get ready, please!

04:57.960 --> 05:00.650
Kaname doesn't understand at all.

05:00.650 --> 05:03.900
I'm not satisfied with just winning.

05:05.700 --> 05:07.020
In other words...

05:07.020 --> 05:07.920
Ready!

05:12.220 --> 05:13.330
I'll show you!

05:20.990 --> 05:22.520
And you were last place.

05:22.520 --> 05:24.750
You didn't even win.

05:24.750 --> 05:26.510
This feeling of satisfaction...

05:26.510 --> 05:27.590
He's useless.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.960
Ikasama-senpai, good job!

05:29.960 --> 05:31.480
Thanks!

05:31.480 --> 05:34.270
But I'm Ikamasa, not Ikasama.

05:34.270 --> 05:36.470
Oh, really?

05:36.470 --> 05:38.520
Makio-chan!

05:39.520 --> 05:42.030
Go for it! Go for it! Go for it!

05:42.390 --> 05:44.060
She's useless, too.

05:44.060 --> 05:46.980
Even if she was allowed to use the kicking board, she can't swim...

05:46.980 --> 05:49.550
Makio-chan, go for it!

05:49.550 --> 05:50.590
Come here.

05:50.590 --> 05:51.990
Kaname-chan?

05:52.800 --> 05:53.810
What, what?

05:53.810 --> 05:55.340
You want to tell me a secret?

05:55.340 --> 05:57.610
I've got cheering for the others taken care of.

05:57.610 --> 06:00.550
Pretend this bench is the platform and practice diving in.

06:01.170 --> 06:02.000
Like this?

06:03.910 --> 06:05.660
Not like that.

06:05.660 --> 06:07.410
Can't you do it normally?

06:07.410 --> 06:08.010
Normal?

06:08.010 --> 06:08.910
Here.

06:08.910 --> 06:09.860
Do this.

06:09.860 --> 06:11.890
Wrap your toes around the platform,

06:13.840 --> 06:15.930
and put your weight forward.

06:21.400 --> 06:23.900
What if I fell into real water?!

06:23.900 --> 06:26.940
You're really good at teaching.

06:27.290 --> 06:29.710
Makio-chan said so, too.

06:29.710 --> 06:35.270
She said that because you teach her so well, she's slowly learning how to swim.

06:36.870 --> 06:40.960
You should just try to learn how to swim yourself!

06:40.960 --> 06:45.420
L-Like I said, I just like being a supporter for everyone.

06:45.420 --> 06:48.210
It's all right, so practice the start.

06:48.210 --> 06:49.300
Okay!

06:49.650 --> 06:51.180
Go!

06:57.500 --> 06:58.900
Go, Shizuoka-san!

06:59.400 --> 07:00.380
Shizuoka-san!

07:01.560 --> 07:03.150
I love you!  Go!

07:03.500 --> 07:06.330
Even the guys from other schools are cheering for her.

07:06.330 --> 07:08.110
She must be some kind of demon.

07:09.360 --> 07:11.990
Shizuoka-tan is nice, too.

07:11.990 --> 07:13.350
Shizuoka-tan.

07:13.350 --> 07:17.810
Domon-sensei, aren't the students of Takura high school in the 3rd and 4th lane?

07:18.690 --> 07:21.870
I-I have to take videos of rival schools!

07:36.010 --> 07:39.890
At this rate, we'll be in last place overall.

07:39.890 --> 07:43.150
But we really are weak.

07:43.150 --> 07:46.360
We barely got 3 people who were in the top places.

07:46.650 --> 07:48.360
Since the boys were all in last place.

07:50.210 --> 07:56.490
The schools are different, so the look of the bathing suits are different, too.

07:58.960 --> 08:00.310
No way!

08:00.310 --> 08:02.330
We must avoid last place at all costs!

08:02.740 --> 08:04.560
Who hasn't raced yet?!

08:04.560 --> 08:08.290
The swimmers participating in the women's 50 meter freestyle, please get ready.

08:08.640 --> 08:09.840
Okay!

08:10.270 --> 08:11.540
Ninagawa-san?!

08:11.540 --> 08:13.590
It's Amuro-senpai's turn!

08:18.680 --> 08:21.720
Um, don't get on the platform yet.

08:22.140 --> 08:24.160
Is she going to be okay?

08:24.160 --> 08:29.280
Come to think of it, Okiura-kun, you taught her the proper way to start, right?

08:29.280 --> 08:30.150
Y-Yes.

08:30.150 --> 08:31.480
I did it a few minutes ago.

08:32.530 --> 08:34.490
Um, um.

08:34.840 --> 08:37.740
Wrap your toes around the platform,

08:38.090 --> 08:40.700
and put your weight forward.

08:45.580 --> 08:48.440
Hey, that looks pretty good.

08:48.440 --> 08:50.660
I'm getting nervous.

08:50.660 --> 08:51.590
Ready!

08:52.070 --> 08:53.530
This girl...

08:55.290 --> 08:57.210
might make it happen.

09:03.230 --> 09:04.440
Go!

09:04.790 --> 09:06.780
The swimmer in lane 2 is really fast!

09:06.780 --> 09:07.910
Is that the girl from Umisho?!

09:07.910 --> 09:09.690
Hey, hey, she's still submerged.

09:14.940 --> 09:16.700
What's with this girl...

09:16.950 --> 09:18.110
This speed...

09:18.690 --> 09:22.310
We never got an official time of her swim, but...

09:22.310 --> 09:23.260
that girl...

09:23.260 --> 09:24.370
Could it be?

09:25.130 --> 09:26.460
She's awesome...

09:30.080 --> 09:32.090
A new high school record...

09:35.490 --> 09:36.970
This girl's swimming style...

09:36.970 --> 09:39.530
Lane 2 is disqualified!

09:41.270 --> 09:42.560
Disqualified?!

09:43.110 --> 09:45.120
That's right!

09:45.120 --> 09:46.570
Why is that?

09:46.570 --> 09:47.940
Why is she disqualified?

09:48.310 --> 09:53.940
You get disqualified if you don't get your head out of the water within the first 15 meters.

09:53.940 --> 09:55.900
What?!

09:57.220 --> 09:59.170
The tri-meet ended

09:59.170 --> 10:01.220
with us in last place.

10:03.680 --> 10:06.250
Why didn't you teach her the rules?!

10:06.910 --> 10:08.460
My fault?!

10:08.710 --> 10:12.220
We went to another school, only to be embarrassed by this!

10:15.480 --> 10:17.430
That was a good nap.

10:17.430 --> 10:19.130
Wasn't that fun?

10:19.130 --> 10:19.930
Yeah!

10:20.350 --> 10:22.510
Let's go have fun at another meet!

10:22.510 --> 10:23.960
It's not for fun!

10:37.350 --> 10:40.860
Now that the tri-meet is done, we get a rare break.

10:48.410 --> 10:53.200
On hot days like this, being lazy and playing games all day is...

10:53.200 --> 10:55.920
Kaname-chan!

10:55.920 --> 10:58.070
Let's go out!

11:00.050 --> 11:02.040
Where are you going?

11:02.040 --> 11:05.760
It's hot today, so I don't really want to go out...

11:06.030 --> 11:08.270
A fun place!

11:18.440 --> 11:20.490
So many people!

11:20.490 --> 11:23.030
This is just a local beach.

11:23.430 --> 11:26.970
Hey, you do remember that I can't swim, right?

11:26.970 --> 11:28.270
Hey!  Look, look.

11:31.330 --> 11:33.510
Ta-da!

11:37.890 --> 11:39.050
How do I look?

11:39.050 --> 11:41.520
How... Well, that's...

11:42.240 --> 11:43.980
That's not a competition suit.

11:43.980 --> 11:46.600
I wanted to show this to Kaname-chan.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.740
Is it sexy?

11:48.830 --> 11:51.190
Not... really...

11:52.480 --> 11:54.100
This is not bad at all.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.960
It can get undone since it's a string bikini.

11:56.960 --> 11:57.610
Here.

11:58.910 --> 12:00.650
You don't have to show me!

12:02.240 --> 12:03.590
Yay!

12:05.190 --> 12:07.030
Geez...

12:10.210 --> 12:12.040
But now that I think about it,

12:12.040 --> 12:15.590
when two people go to a beach together,

12:15.590 --> 12:18.120
t-they call it a date, don't they?

12:18.610 --> 12:20.590
Not bad at all.

12:28.970 --> 12:30.380
If I could...

12:32.130 --> 12:34.890
go in the ocean...

12:36.370 --> 12:38.940
Kaname-chan!

12:38.940 --> 12:41.450
Kaname-chan, you should come in, too!

12:41.450 --> 12:43.570
It feels great!

12:43.570 --> 12:46.200
Like I said, I can't swim.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.520
What is that?

12:50.520 --> 12:51.200
Oh no...

12:51.200 --> 12:53.210
Isn't that a shark?!

12:55.740 --> 12:56.880
It's a shark!

13:09.950 --> 13:12.390
Kaname-chan!

13:12.390 --> 13:16.100
The people left all of a sudden, so you should come in too, Kaname-chan!

13:18.370 --> 13:19.960
Amuro, it's a shark!

13:19.960 --> 13:20.820
Come back!

13:20.820 --> 13:21.980
Come back now!

13:22.330 --> 13:24.480
Kaname-chan is waving at me, too.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.490
No!

13:30.990 --> 13:32.370
Crap!

13:33.910 --> 13:36.470
But, I can't swim...

13:38.100 --> 13:39.490
This is it...

13:39.490 --> 13:41.210
Amuro...

13:44.080 --> 13:45.270
Kaname-chan?

13:45.270 --> 13:47.000
Look behind you!

13:48.390 --> 13:49.720
What?!

13:49.720 --> 13:51.510
Amuro!

13:56.600 --> 13:58.350
M-My leg!

13:58.350 --> 14:00.740
Amuro!

14:01.510 --> 14:04.250
Didn't something like this happen before?

14:04.920 --> 14:06.900
She didn't drown that time,

14:06.900 --> 14:09.320
but Ono-chan, the seal, grabbed Amuro's leg...

14:12.200 --> 14:14.120
It's not Ono-chan!

14:14.380 --> 14:15.620
H-Help!

14:15.620 --> 14:17.050
Kaname!

14:18.050 --> 14:19.150
I knew it!

14:20.070 --> 14:21.170
Amuro!

14:22.900 --> 14:24.170
Kaname-ch...

14:24.510 --> 14:25.670
Amuro!

14:26.800 --> 14:28.240
H-Help!

14:30.890 --> 14:32.640
Stop tickling me!

14:36.350 --> 14:38.850
Oh, Kaname's here, too.

14:39.190 --> 14:40.480
Captain!

14:40.480 --> 14:42.460
What's with that outfit?!

14:42.460 --> 14:47.190
Well, I was having fun giving the beach goers a little bit of a scare.

14:47.190 --> 14:48.130
Teehee.

14:48.130 --> 14:49.660
This is no time to be teehee-ing!

14:49.660 --> 14:51.090
This isn't a joke!

14:51.090 --> 14:53.590
Anyway, what are you two doing together?

14:53.590 --> 14:55.370
A date? A date?

14:58.020 --> 15:00.250
It's not like that!

15:02.170 --> 15:06.030
It's not a date when two people go to the beach together?

15:06.030 --> 15:06.800
Um, that's not...

15:10.610 --> 15:12.350
C-Captain!

15:12.350 --> 15:13.660
Kaname-chan.

15:14.410 --> 15:20.680
Did you worry about me so much that you came to save me even though you can't swim, Kaname-chan?

15:26.070 --> 15:27.230
So you did.

15:28.230 --> 15:29.790
Thanks!

15:29.790 --> 15:30.570
S-Stop!

15:33.300 --> 15:35.230
Laa-tee-daa.

15:35.230 --> 15:36.210
You touched me.

15:36.700 --> 15:39.310
You touched me. You touched me. You touched me.

15:39.310 --> 15:42.090
I-I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I-I-I'm...

15:44.840 --> 15:46.240
H-Help!

15:47.090 --> 15:48.590
Kaname-chan.

15:54.470 --> 15:55.600
Don't come near me!

15:57.100 --> 15:58.100
All right!

15:58.440 --> 15:59.100
Huh?

16:05.190 --> 16:06.950
You got in! You got in!

16:06.950 --> 16:09.800
See? The water is higher than your knees!

16:10.380 --> 16:13.170
See? You got into deeper water!

16:13.700 --> 16:15.280
Kaname-chan!

16:15.280 --> 16:17.280
You can do it when you put your mind to it!

16:18.150 --> 16:21.930
The mermaid disappeared when I held Amuro's hand.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.330
See?

16:24.330 --> 16:27.290
Aren't you glad we came to the ocean?

16:27.790 --> 16:32.010
D-Did she bring me to the ocean for this?

16:32.090 --> 16:35.590
Back at the pool, you made a face like you wanted to swim.

16:37.890 --> 16:38.800
Geez...

16:39.610 --> 16:41.810
I don't know if she's naturally like that, or what she's thinking...

16:44.950 --> 16:48.810
Kaname, you can get in the water now, huh?

16:48.810 --> 16:52.240
Then let's have some fun!

16:52.610 --> 16:56.240
Kaname-chan, wouldn't it be great if you could go deeper in the water...

16:56.630 --> 16:59.720
and swim with me one day?

16:59.720 --> 17:02.190
All right!

17:02.630 --> 17:04.330
I'm gonna die!

18:45.860 --> 18:47.620
Hey, Ninagawa-san!

18:47.620 --> 18:49.970
Practice according to the schedule!

18:53.100 --> 18:54.520
I'm okay.

18:54.520 --> 18:57.290
I won't screw up at the next meet.

18:57.290 --> 18:58.860
What are you, a sea lion?

18:59.230 --> 19:00.420
"Next?"

19:00.420 --> 19:02.300
The next meet is the real meet.

19:02.300 --> 19:06.120
Geez, this girl and Ikamasa are so easygoing.

19:06.460 --> 19:08.120
Don't worry...

19:09.620 --> 19:12.980
H-Hey, what's wrong, Ikamasa?!

19:12.980 --> 19:14.130
What's wrong?

19:18.740 --> 19:21.640
Your family-owned Japanese restaurant is about to be shut down?!

19:21.640 --> 19:25.100
Last month, a dining bar opened next to our Japanese restaurant,

19:25.320 --> 19:29.520
and since then, we've had almost no business.

19:31.650 --> 19:34.640
Oh, that fancy place.

19:34.640 --> 19:37.330
I heard it's really popular.

19:38.240 --> 19:40.740
Even if you say that...

19:41.080 --> 19:43.800
No, Momoko!

19:43.800 --> 19:45.760
Don't abandon me!

19:46.470 --> 19:47.870
Wait for me!

19:46.470 --> 19:47.870
H-Hey!

19:47.870 --> 19:49.260
I got it. I got it.

19:49.260 --> 19:51.870
Are those two dating?

19:51.870 --> 19:53.580
No, I don't think so.

19:54.760 --> 19:57.210
Do you have any good ideas?

19:57.210 --> 19:59.130
Ideas, huh?

19:59.130 --> 20:00.280
Yep, yep!

20:00.280 --> 20:02.410
All food is free!

20:02.410 --> 20:05.340
That statement makes it hard to believe that you're a high school student.

20:05.340 --> 20:08.030
Maybe you could use some amazing food.

20:08.030 --> 20:09.050
Amazing?

20:09.050 --> 20:09.940
Like bugs...

20:09.940 --> 20:10.930
Overruled!

20:11.220 --> 20:16.060
U-Um, I thought of something.

20:22.820 --> 20:25.200
We are now in bathing suits?

20:25.540 --> 20:26.700
What does that mean?

20:32.170 --> 20:34.880
Welcome-oma!

20:34.880 --> 20:37.310
T-This is...

20:37.310 --> 20:39.030
Now, now, come in.

20:39.030 --> 20:40.380
Yes, yes.

20:41.350 --> 20:43.800
Shizuoka-san, this is a great idea.

20:44.140 --> 20:49.680
W-Well, they have maid cafes and stuff, so I figured this would work as well.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.920
But!

20:51.920 --> 20:56.020
Dressing up like this, and saying "oma" too...

20:56.310 --> 20:58.830
I'm sorry, young lady.

20:58.830 --> 21:01.530
Since I'm such a big idiot.

21:02.050 --> 21:03.300
No, no.

21:03.300 --> 21:04.490
That's not true.

21:04.490 --> 21:05.490
Masa!

21:05.490 --> 21:08.370
You have great friends!

21:08.370 --> 21:10.030
Dad!

21:10.380 --> 21:16.190
And to hear this from that pure Shizuoka-san...

21:16.190 --> 21:19.000
I can understand why she said it.

21:20.260 --> 21:21.380
Welcome!

21:21.920 --> 21:23.590
They're really wearing bathing suits!

21:25.510 --> 21:27.590
This might really work.

21:27.590 --> 21:29.600
Here's the angler liver-oma!

21:30.390 --> 21:33.240
Shizuoka-san, this is pretty fun-oma.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.600
Y-Yes.

21:34.940 --> 21:37.850
But, they are looking at me.

21:38.240 --> 21:41.360
My chest stands out,

21:41.700 --> 21:44.860
so they are definitely looking at me.

21:47.410 --> 21:49.990
What's with Ninagawa-san?

21:49.990 --> 21:51.910
She's really pushing herself.

21:51.910 --> 21:54.430
Are you really in high school?

21:54.430 --> 21:55.750
Yes.

21:55.750 --> 21:57.670
Let me pour it for you.

21:57.670 --> 21:58.750
Here.

22:02.340 --> 22:04.870
Open wide.

22:05.330 --> 22:06.840
Senpai.

22:07.110 --> 22:09.900
I can't thank you all enough!

22:09.900 --> 22:12.570
We've never had this much profit before!

22:12.570 --> 22:13.910
That's right!

22:13.910 --> 22:15.810
We're glad that we could help.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.250
Excuse us.

22:17.250 --> 22:19.520
I'll see you tomorrow-oma!

22:19.870 --> 22:22.310
Well, that was really embarrassing.

22:22.310 --> 22:24.930
But I'm glad it went well!

22:24.930 --> 22:28.330
Well, no matter what happens, it's much better than the store being shut down.

22:28.330 --> 22:30.280
Yeah, you're right about that.

22:31.790 --> 22:34.330
I hope they don't let the success go to their head.

22:34.560 --> 22:37.290
Now, let's do our best during practice today!

22:37.630 --> 22:40.830
Say that after you've actually done your scheduled practice!

22:40.830 --> 22:42.170
Hey!

22:45.750 --> 22:48.040
Thanks for yesterday.

22:48.040 --> 22:49.170
For you...

22:50.940 --> 22:53.720
W-Why are you dressed like that?

22:54.610 --> 22:56.040
What's that?

22:56.040 --> 22:58.180
A-Aren't you suspiciously rich?

22:58.480 --> 23:00.280
Now, don't worry.

23:00.280 --> 23:02.340
We're making money.

23:02.340 --> 23:04.910
I'm paying for all of these in installments!

23:05.970 --> 23:08.060
Being rich is great!

23:08.060 --> 23:10.700
I'll treat you all next week,

23:10.700 --> 23:12.200
so help us today, too.

23:14.200 --> 23:16.590
I'll leave it to you guys again.

23:17.330 --> 23:20.130
Say "oma", okay?

23:21.010 --> 23:22.240
Now, now.

23:23.190 --> 23:25.400
Hey, we got customers.

23:25.400 --> 23:27.460
Welcome-oma!

23:27.770 --> 23:32.760
It's pretty influential, but are they really thinking about the future?

23:32.760 --> 23:36.940
I'm sorry, Kaname, but can you work the cash register today?

23:41.470 --> 23:44.210
Yeah, make sure you give those envelopes to the customers.

23:44.210 --> 23:45.210
Envelopes?

23:46.680 --> 23:47.820
This?

23:48.540 --> 23:49.710
What is it?

23:49.710 --> 23:51.370
A coupon?

23:56.080 --> 23:58.150
Thank you very much-oma!

23:58.610 --> 24:02.000
Two beers, a motsuni, and sashimi-oma!

24:02.950 --> 24:04.170
Um...

24:04.170 --> 24:05.310
This is...

24:06.990 --> 24:08.910
Hey, Kaname...

24:08.910 --> 24:10.880
You'll understand if you're a man, right?

24:11.230 --> 24:12.430
What everyone--

24:12.430 --> 24:14.190
wants.

24:14.190 --> 24:15.720
What is this?

24:17.160 --> 24:18.470
What is it?

24:18.980 --> 24:20.350
Live photos.

24:20.350 --> 24:21.430
Goods?

24:28.580 --> 24:30.990
Ow.

24:31.390 --> 24:34.570
With this, the bathing suit Japanese restaurant ended in just two days.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.950
Now, let's practice!

24:39.200 --> 24:42.140
1, 2, 3, 4.

24:42.140 --> 24:43.660
5, 6...

24:43.660 --> 24:44.960
Don't worry.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.840
What the Umisho swimming team lacks is,

24:49.050 --> 24:50.760
yes, we are lacking team work!

24:51.010 --> 24:56.170
We need to go to a training camp to better our team work!

24:56.170 --> 24:57.840
Well, going to training camp is fine, but...

24:59.340 --> 25:01.520
Are you saying that my body is not attractive?!

25:01.520 --> 25:04.900
I, too. I really, I, too...

25:04.900 --> 25:06.990
Where is this place?!

25:06.990 --> 25:10.420
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho...

25:10.420 --> 25:12.170
"I'm going to show you"
